<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, position: 'relative', background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 62, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
            结论、局限与下一步
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.72)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>
            04 · 问题、结论与展望
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 108, width: 620, height: 2, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 120, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>
        三条结论
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 156, width: 620, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>01</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>定位成立</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    价值不在课程数量，而在「完成状态」成为工坊可用的准入依据
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>02</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>需求可验收</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    6 项目标、38 项功能、12 项性能口径、9 类错误码，评审可逐条对照
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', paddingTop: 14, paddingBottom: 14, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
            <Text style={{ width: 40, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3D7BD9' }}>03</Text>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>主干可跑通</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                    真实服务器上「课程 → 学习 → 完成」链路与部署运维流程均已验证
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 108, width: 480, height: 2, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 120, fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4A5568' }}>
        三项局限
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 156, width: 480, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            实现与 SRS 技术基线不一致：验证环境由开源云课堂改造，前端并非 React + TypeScript。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            SSO 与事件通道尚未在真实认证中心联调，PKCE、单点退出目前只有设计与时序验证。
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
            性能指标是设计目标：单机未做 500 并发压测；内容仅 9 门课程，「审核一次通过率」没有统计样本。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 350, width: 480, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 364, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>
        下一步
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 740, top: 394, width: 480, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
            V1.1：接入认证中心正式环境与统一事件通道，补 outbox 重试与人工重放演练
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
            V1.2：按 SRS 以 React 重写前端，补 500 并发压测、灰度发布与备份恢复演练
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 556, width: 1160, height: 64, background: '#F7F9FC', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 20 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
            答辩立场：需求与边界的定义可以交付，实现层面还有一版差距——
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>这一版差距已写进计划，而不是藏在结论里</span>。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 656, width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 668, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>警院 WeChat 全生态 · 自学平台 答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>20 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
